00:24:44.535 --> 00:24:45.102
Alan was born on JULY first,

00:24:45.102 --> 00:24:47.102
1955 in santa maria.

00:24:48.705 --> 00:24:49.473
>> a graduate of the university

00:24:49.473 --> 00:24:50.740
of california berkeley college

00:24:50.740 --> 00:24:52.740
of environmental design.

00:24:52.675 --> 00:24:55.111
In 1977 alan worked as a

00:24:55.111 --> 00:24:55.845
licensed architect for four

00:24:55.845 --> 00:24:58.214
decades designing spaces that

00:24:58.214 --> 00:24:58.882
connected contemporary forms

00:24:58.882 --> 00:24:59.549
with historical narratives.

00:24:59.549 --> 00:25:02.419
He served on the historic

00:25:02.419 --> 00:25:02.987
preservation advisory board

00:25:02.987 --> 00:25:03.587
historic preservation

00:25:03.587 --> 00:25:05.923
commission and the store

00:25:05.923 --> 00:25:06.490
preservation fund committee

00:25:06.490 --> 00:25:07.124
and was instrumental

00:25:07.124 --> 00:25:09.124
in safeguarding landmarks

00:25:09.493 --> 00:25:10.160
and cultural sites.

00:25:10.160 --> 00:25:10.827
Among his achievements he

00:25:10.827 --> 00:25:12.929
coauthored with his fellow

00:25:12.929 --> 00:25:13.630
commissioner diane masuda a

00:25:13.630 --> 00:25:14.364
resolution to adopt social

00:25:14.364 --> 00:25:16.767
heritage resources as part of

00:25:16.767 --> 00:25:17.534
the planning department's

00:25:17.534 --> 00:25:18.134
contact statements an important

00:25:18.134 --> 00:25:20.534
step in recognizing the

00:25:20.671 --> 00:25:21.500
cultural layers of urban

00:25:21.500 --> 00:25:21.739
spaces.

00:25:21.739 --> 00:25:24.508
He was also a coauthor of the

00:25:24.508 --> 00:25:25.109
san francisco citywide pan

00:25:25.109 --> 00:25:27.109
latino context statement

00:25:28.412 --> 00:25:29.113
and was deeply involved in the

00:25:29.113 --> 00:25:31.513
landmarking of the carnival

00:25:32.820 --> 00:25:35.820
and charter murals with the

00:25:36.530 --> 00:25:36.821
