00:26:33.478 --> 00:26:34.112
steward of preservation and a

00:26:34.112 --> 00:26:34.746
tireless advocate for the

00:26:34.746 --> 00:26:36.746
stories that buildings

00:26:36.915 --> 00:26:37.582
